# Copy to server/.env — loaded automatically at startup. Real environment variables take precedence.

# Claude-powered AI Director. Without a key the deterministic offline Director runs instead.
# ANTHROPIC_API_KEY=sk-ant-...

# Claude model the Director uses (optional; director.ts has a default).
# DIRECTOR_MODEL=

# Force the offline Director even when a key is set: DIRECTOR_ENGINE=offline
# DIRECTOR_ENGINE=

# HTTP + WebSocket port (default 8787).
# PORT=8787
